      "text_original": "Little Goat went to find the sweetest grass. The sky was blue above. But she did not look up.",
      "text_zh": "小山羊出发去找最甜的青草。头顶的天空蓝蓝的，可她没有抬头看。",
      "image_alt": "小山羊走在青草地上，头顶是一片蓝色天空。",
      "image": "/assets/books/bd-little-goat/page-001.jpg",
      "audio_zh": "/assets/books/bd-little-goat/audio/zh/d6c5756c6f28294d/page-001.mp3",
